                "tldr": "Red Card, an alternative guest worker proposal, would better coordinate labor markets as mentioned in this paper, which is the most efficient solution to the mismatch between the demand for foreign workers from U.S. businesses and their supply, leading to the illegal immigration situation we confront today.",
