                "source": "scispace",
                "relevance_summary": "Uses racial incarceration ratios to explain variations in state corrections spending; cites per\u2011inmate cost figures and regional budget differences, but lacks detailed cost breakdowns, age\u2011based analysis, or revenue discussions.",
                "relevance_metadata": {
                    "criteria_judgments": [
