                },
                "tldr": "The question of whether cost should matter when it comes to deciding who goes to prison and for how long has been investigated in the United States as discussed by the authors, and the standard answer to this question has been no.",
                "podcast": null,
                "podcast_generation_allowed": true,
                "entity_type": "PAPER",
