            "relevance_ZwZUXa": "- **Relevance Score:** 30/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Marginally Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses BJS data to compare incarceration costs versus crime\u2011prevention benefits, directly addressing economic trade\u2011offs. Lacks cost component breakdowns, budget details, demographic cost links, or revenue analysis.",
