                "tldr": "Nonprofit-led small business development initiatives can reduce the economic burden of prisons by equipping formerly incarcerated individuals with entrepreneurial skills, promoting economic empowerment, and social reintegration, thereby disrupting cycles of recidivism and fostering innovation.",
