                "google_scholar_id": "p8ZFFbVS4GEJ",
                "snippet": "\u2026 That is, the spending effects are somewhat ambiguous. As we will argue, this ambiguity \u2026 patterns of prison overcrowding cases in four states. Second, we examine the spending patterns \u2026",
