                "tldr": "Coley and Barton as mentioned in this paper provide a broad perspective on the U.S. prison population and offer judgments about the status of prison education programs, concluding that investment in correctional education programs is not keeping pace with the exploding population of prisoners.",
                "podcast": null,
                "podcast_generation_allowed": true,
                "entity_type": "PAPER",
                "score": 0.49714416,
