                "title": "The Institutional Effects of Incarceration: Spillovers From Criminal Justice to Health Care",
                "is_archived": false,
                "full_slug": "the-institutional-effects-of-incarceration-spillovers-from-4yky5z2v23",
                "journal": {
                    "display_name": "Milbank Quarterly",
                    "official_page": "http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/journal/10.1111/(ISSN)1468-0009",
