                "tldr": "This paper will explain why adopting the Crisis Intervention Team (CIT) model is thought to be the best plan for training correctional officers to understand and work with the demographic needs of the prison environment and explain how adapting this method of training will help improve early detection of dementia within correctional institutions.",
                "podcast": null,
                "podcast_generation_allowed": true,
                "entity_type": "PAPER",
                "score": 0.46847504,
                "section_names": [
                    "Incarceration rates and demographics"
                ],
                "rank": 16,
                "relevance_data": {},
                "source": "scispace_full_text",
